            "text": "{\"findings\":[{\"tipo\":\"GC\",\"causa_raiz\":\"Alocacao excessiva de memoria gerenciada no frame 170 (5.15 MB alocados), disparando uma coleta de lixo (GC.Collect) que congelou a CPU por 22.75 ms. Esse padrao costuma ser causado por instanciacao de objetos, concatenacao de strings, uso de LINQ ou criacao repetida de arrays/listas dentro de metodos de atualizacao continua como Update().\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using UnityEngine;\\\\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\\\\n\\\\npublic class OptimizedEntityManager : MonoBehaviour\\\\n{\\\\n    [SerializeField] private GameObject prefab;\\\\n    [SerializeField] private int poolSize = 100;\\\\n\\\\n    private readonly Queue\u003cGameObject\u003e pool = new Queue\u003cGameObject\u003e();\\\\n    private readonly List\u003cGameObject\u003e activeObjects = new List\u003cGameObject\u003e(128);\\\\n\\\\n    private void Awake()\\\\n    {\\\\n        for (int i = 0; i \u003c poolSize; i++)\\\\n        {\\\\n            GameObject obj = Instantiate(prefab, transform);\\\\n            obj.SetActive(false);\\\\n            pool.Enqueue(obj);\\\\n        }\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    public GameObject Spawn(Vector3 position, Quaternion rotation)\\\\n    {\\\\n        GameObject obj = pool.Count \u003e 0 ? pool.Dequeue() : Instantiate(prefab);\\\\n        obj.transform.SetPositionAndRotation(position, rotation);\\\\n        obj.SetActive(true);\\\\n        activeObjects.Add(obj);\\\\n        return obj;\\\\n    }\\\\n\\\\n    public void Despawn(GameObject obj)\\\\n    {\\\\n        obj.SetActive(false);\\\\n        activeObjects.Remove(obj);\\\\n        pool.Enqueue(obj);\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"A memoria do jogo estava sendo sobrecarregada por criacao constante de novos dados na memoria gerenciada. Quando a lixeira do Unity (o Garbage Collector) enche, o jogo pausa momentaneamente (quase 23 ms neste caso) para limpar a memoria descartada, causando travamentos visiveis (stuttering). Ao reutilizar objetos e colecoes com tecnicas como Object Pooling e pre-alocacao de listas, evitamos alocar memoria em tempo de execucao, eliminando as paradas do Garbage Collector.\"}],\"dicas_level_design\":null}",
